      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 4.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I mean, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.06,
      "end_seconds": 10.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.27,
      "end_seconds": 17.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Well, I've been having blurred vision in one eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.78,
      "end_seconds": 22.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.49,
      "end_seconds": 27.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.5,
      "end_seconds": 31.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.56,
      "end_seconds": 33.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.65,
      "end_seconds": 48.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.41,
      "end_seconds": 58.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.53,
      "end_seconds": 78.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 108 over 71, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temp 36.9 degrees. And pulse is 83 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.21,
      "end_seconds": 84.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.48,
      "end_seconds": 88.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.04,
      "end_seconds": 110.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "The temporal artery is hard, tender and has no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.22,
      "end_seconds": 112.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.95,
      "end_seconds": 117.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.62,
      "end_seconds": 129.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Any fever, shoulder stiffness or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.0,
      "end_seconds": 136.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "uh, no fever, shoulder stiffness or weight loss, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.86,
      "end_seconds": 140.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.82,
      "end_seconds": 144.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.03,
      "end_seconds": 162.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.35,
      "end_seconds": 167.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.57,
      "end_seconds": 172.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Right, right. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.3,
      "end_seconds": 175.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.03,
      "end_seconds": 178.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.49,
      "end_seconds": 181.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.84,
      "end_seconds": 193.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Right, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.94,
      "end_seconds": 196.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Escitalopram, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.51,
      "end_seconds": 199.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.53,
      "end_seconds": 205.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "10 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.04,
      "end_seconds": 212.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Right, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 217.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.62,
      "end_seconds": 221.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.02,
      "end_seconds": 225.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.82,
      "end_seconds": 260.13,
      "duration_seconds": 33.31,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? My working impression is possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'll request a temporal artery biopsy, it'll help with possible giant cell arteritis. Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for possible giant cell arteritis. I'd like you to take prednisolone, 60 milligrams, once a day, until review. It's for possible giant cell arteritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.73,
      "end_seconds": 263.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Fine, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.5,
      "end_seconds": 282.0,
      "duration_seconds": 16.5,
      "text": "Start the steroid today, this is to protect your sight. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. The thing that would worry me is if you lose vision. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.64,
      "end_seconds": 288.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "let's plan a check tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.14,
      "end_seconds": 292.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.03,
      "end_seconds": 295.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.93,
      "end_seconds": 299.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
